{"speciesId":589,"names":{"fr":"Lançargot","es":"Escavalier","en":"Escavalier","ja":"シュバルゴ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vole à toute vitesse et frappe tout ennemi de ses lances pointues. Il combat bravement contre les plus forts que lui."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They fly around at high speed, striking with their pointed spears. Even when in trouble, they face opponents bravely."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon qui a évolué en portant la carapace d’un Escargaume. Une armure de fer protège tout son corps."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"These Pokémon evolve by wearing the shell covering of a Shelmet. The steel armor protects their whole body."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Wearing the shell covering they stole from Shelmet, they defend themselves and attack with two lances."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Wearing the shell covering they stole from Shelmet, they defend themselves and attack with two lances."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon se protège avec la carapace dérobée à un Escargaume et attaque avec ses deux redoutables lances."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se defienden de los ataques con el caparazón que roban a los Shelmet. Atacan con sus dos mortíferas lanzas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Wearing the shell covering they stole from Shelmet, they defend themselves and attack with two lances."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"チョボマキから 奪った 殻で 体を 覆い ガードしながら ２本の ヤリで 突いてくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon qui a évolué en portant la carapace d’un Escargaume. Une armure de fer protège tout son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Pokémon que evolucionó poniéndose el caparazón de Shelmet. Su armazón de acero le protege todo el cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"These Pokémon evolve by wearing the shell covering of a Shelmet. The steel armor protects their whole body."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"チョボマキの 殻を 身につけて 進化した ポケモン。鋼鉄の よろいが 全身を ガードする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ce Pokémon se protège avec la carapace dérobée à un Escargaume et attaque avec ses deux redoutables lances."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se defienden de los ataques con el caparazón que roban a los Shelmet. Atacan con sus dos mortíferas lanzas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Wearing the shell covering they stole from Shelmet, they defend themselves and attack with two lances."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"チョボマキから 奪った 殻で 体を 覆い ガードしながら ２本の ヤリで 突いてくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un Pokémon qui a évolué en portant la carapace d’un Escargaume. Une armure de fer protège tout son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Pokémon que evolucionó poniéndose el caparazón de Shelmet. Su armazón de acero le protege todo el cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"These Pokémon evolve by wearing the shell covering of a Shelmet. The steel armor protects their whole body."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"チョボマキの 殻を 身につけて 進化した ポケモン。鋼鉄の よろいが 全身を ガードする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il a volé la coquille d’Escargaume pour obtenir une armure parfaite. Il jouit d’une très grande popularité à Galar."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Le roba el caparazón a un Shelmet y lo usa como armadura. Este Pokémon es extremadamente popular en la región de Galar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"They use shells they’ve stolen from Shelmet to arm and protect themselves. They’re very popular Pokémon in the Galar region."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"チョボマキの 殻を 奪って 完全武装。 ガラル地方では 非常に 人気が 高い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il charge ses ennemis en brandissant ses lances. Il existe un célèbre tableau représentant la joute entre un Lançargot et un Palart